    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n581" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκύλ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκύλη,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>loop</i> in noose, <i><span class="en">
				Heracl.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.2.1
			</span></i>; <i>link of a chain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				329
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκύλωσις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.15.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀγκύλια,</span>
